        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>11-13/16 Inch Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 11-13/16 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Door Pull has a modern, look with clean lines and satin stainless steel finish. An extra long flush pull, it is perfect for large doors. The housing between the 1/16\" thick satin stainless steel front and back plates is black high impact plastic, allowing the flush pull to be pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws). It can also be thrubolted from the back side if used on pantry or cabinet door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-FP416-300-630.gif?v=1704354515\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/long-stainless-steel-flush-door-pull-with-flush-cover-ahi-sig771-630\"><b>11-13/16\" Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull with Flush Cover</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG771-630 Long Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 11-13/16\" (300 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-5/32\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 21/32\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 9-13/16\" (250 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Height: 10-15/16\" (278 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1-13/16\" (46 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> Finish</li>\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-FSB-4251-630.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI-FSB-4251-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
